---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Press Kit | Trove Collections">
  <section class="press">
    <h1>Press Kit</h1>
    <h2>Micki Sharp</h2>
    <p>Micki Sharp is a Boeing 777 captain and Check Airman from a four-generation aviation
    family — her grandfather soloed in 1928, and the family will mark one hundred continuous
    years of flight in 2028. Her aviation writing has appeared in <em>General Aviation News</em>
    and <em>The Aviation Geek Club</em>. She is the co-founder of Trove Collections.
    <em>City of Trove</em>, an archaeological adventure thriller and the first in a planned
    series, is her debut novel (Trove Collections Press, coming this fall).</p>

    <h2>Selected writing</h2>
    <p>"If You Fly It, Fix It" — <em>General Aviation News</em>, July 2026 ·
    the Y-12 ferry story — <em>The Aviation Geek Club</em>, 2026</p>

    <h2>The story behind the book</h2>
    <p>A hundred-year flying family writes a novel about a four-hundred-generation hereditary
    watch. The documented family history lives on our <a href="/heritage">Heritage</a> page;
    the airplanes live in <a href="/hangar">The Hangar</a>.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>hello@trovecollections.com — interview and photo requests welcome. High-resolution
    author photos and family-archive images available on request.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .press { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 0 3rem; }
  .press h1 { letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .press h2 { margin-top: 1.6rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
</style>
